// Reward - FlashbackLeft 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P808878543" "The first thing you need to know about Longbow is that they're desperate out here. Darwin is their main base of operations, anything else outside of it is... <i>weak</i> at best.<br><br>I tried to tell them that, but of course, they all simply laughed at my proposals. Well, we'll see who is laughing now, won't we?<br><br>I know exactly where their weak points are, and if they won't fix them, then we'll <i>exploit</i> them. The first strike will be against a communications team they've sent out."
// AcceptString :
"P2855509420" "And the point of this team?"
// SendOffString :
"P1734122130" "It was going to be to set up satellite devices throughout the area to monitor Darwin's Landing and Mercy City.<br><br>There should be three key devices on <color yellow>Communication Experts</color>. If you can stop them, it'll leave Longbow <i>blind</i> to our next movements."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2830825044" "Retrieve the devices from Longbow Communication Experts"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3607225693" "I have to stay back here in the shadows, {HeroName}. Longbow can't know where I am."
// TaskTitle :
"P1542399355" "<color deepskyblue>Price of Friendship</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4276330399" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Cutting off Service</color>"
// VillainDescription :
"P1638025612" "{Remain} devices to find"
// VillainSingularDescription :
"P310315295" "One more device to find"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBeginFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3424065122" "You've disabled Longbow's communications!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3826325947" "Excellent! Longbow will not know what's coming now until it's too late.<br><br>You heard a call from Lt. Page? Hrmph. Her false sense of <i>caring</i> is obvious. She is just doing that to save face to the higher ups, to say she 'tried' to look for me.<br><br>Unfortunately for her, I'm putting <i>much</i> more effort towards my own efforts in showing her and Longbow <i>just</i> what I'm capable of!"
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1575596302" "There's a lot of ground to cover between here and Fort Darwin, {HeroName}.<br><br>From what I understand, Longbow has dropped supplies for their soldiers in Darwin's Landing. That would be the first target you should hit.<br><br>Down the road, they've set up a temporary rendezvouz point at the Mercy Clocktower. Taking down Longbow there will cut them off from the remaining area of Darwin's Landing.<br><br>They've also employed those foolish magicians in the <color yellow>Legacy Chain</color> to place down protective runes. I don't believe in that magic, but you may wish to destroy them to be on the safe side. That, {HeroName}, is what you'll be encountering."
// AcceptString :
"P1986586039" "Alright. I have to ask, though. -What- did Page do to cause you to go through all of this?"
// SendOffString :
"P351680906" "She <i>rejected</i> me, {HeroName}. Now, hear me out. I confessed to her that I had some certain feelings towards her. She not only rejected me, but then she treated me as if I was an <i>idiot</i> and <i>lower</i> than her.<br><br>What's worse is that <i>all</i> of the soldiers stationed in Fort Darwin began to do the same! I saw it in their eyes, the way they looked at me. I was no longer a brave soldier, I was a fool.<br><br>I couldn't take it anymore, {HeroName}. If Page thinks she can <i>poison</i> my reputation, then she has to be shown what I can <i>really</i> accomplish. That, {HeroName}, is why I am doing all of this, and why I will not stop until I see them all <i>crushed</i>."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2740182055" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: The Winding Road</color>"

