"P773620607" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed> I'm getting some communications regarding a makeshift prison camp Longbow has set up. They're keeping Arachnos prisoners there.<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed> If we can free them, Longbow's attention will be split between you and tracking those prisoners down!"

