// Task - Compound2_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3015248541" "Release the Arachnos Prisoners"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1397290622" "Those Arachnos prisoners will surely cause enough chaos for us to do what we need, {HeroName}!"
// tokenprogressstring :
"P380523125" "{Token} out of 3 groups of prisoners released"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2236407651" "You've rescued enough Arachnos prisoners to disrupt Longbow's operations!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P562936" "I can hear the chaos over the Longbow communicator, {HeroName}. They're all speaking of your name in fear. Even the transmissions I'm getting are getting weaker.<br><br>We have them on the ropes, {HeroName}. Now, it's time to go in for the kill. And I <i>will</i> be there to see the look on Page's face when she realizes just how <i>wrong</i> she was to cross me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Harris 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P802739789" "What... what have I done... what have <i>we</i> done, {HeroName}? I wanted vengeance, I wanted them to pay.<br><br>I wanted... <i>justice</i> for the <i>wrong</i> that I felt! But seeing her dead like that... it doesn't give me anything.<br><br>Was I... was I right in all of this? Was I truly right in trying to stop them? Maybe... there really <i>is</i> something wrong with me."
// Answer Text :
"P1385050402" "No, Harris. You were right. You had to do all of this."
// Answer Text :
"P581323572" "You were wrong, Harris. You killed these people for your own deluded goals."
// Page YouWereRight Text :
"P166729054" "But it doesn't <i>feel</i> right. What am I supposed to do now...?<br><br>All I thought about was getting back at them... I cared about her so much, and then that feeling... it turned so quickly to hatred. <i>Blind</i> hatred, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P3897323635" "Are you having second thoughts about all of this, Harris?"
// Answer Text :
"P1227950339" "Get yourself together, Harris!"
// Page 2ndThoughts Text :
"P3203448071" "Maybe I am, {HeroName}.<br><br>Maybe I was wrong about all of this, about trying to stop Longbow, about making myself help Arachnos... and <i>you</i>."
// Answer Text :
"P3204086476" "What are you getting at?"
// Page PullItTogether Text :
"P3023261344" "I can't! This is all <i>wrong</i>!<br><br>Working with Arachnos... betraying everyone I knew... all over what I thought..."
// Answer Text :
"P3608819099" "What are you trying to say?"
// Page GettingAt Text :
"P2726854254" "I... I don't know.<br><br>I don't have anything left now. My career in Longbow is gone. They've no doubt sent word about my actions.<br><br>I can never return to America, to my family... to my friends.<br><br>The only person I have left now... is you, ironically, {HeroName}, though now, I don't even have anything left to offer you."
// Answer Text :
"P4251842472" "You're a loose end, Harris. You have to be put down. (Fight Harris)"
// Answer Text :
"P79159736" "One day you'll have something to offer me, Harris. (Spare Harris)"
// Page KillHarris Text :
"P2054495429" "I won't... I won't go down without a fight, {HeroName}!"
// Answer Text :
"P2425396993" "(Fight!)"
// Page SpareHarris Text :
"P1089798268" "<color orange>Harris remains silent, staring down at the floor. It's clear that he won't be of any more use in the remaining assault on Fort Darwin.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page YouWereWrong Text :
"P3050096382" "What... <i>what</i>? You thought this entire time that I was wrong?<br><br>Then why, why did you help me?!"
// Answer Text :
"P3250516854" "To destroy Longbow."
// Answer Text :
"P702368439" "You don't need to know why I helped you, Harris."
// Page BringdownLB Text :
"P4083127651" "No... you... you <i>used</i> me! You just thought I was a <i>fool</i>! Like all the others!<br><br>Yes... I see it now, it's all coming together. Your tone with me, the way you looked at me, always looking <i>down</i>! Always <i>judging</i> me!"
// Answer Text :
"P960727823" "And what are you going to do about it now, Harris?"
// Page OwnMotives Text :
"P907251637" "You don't even trust me?!<br><br>You just think... I'm an <i>idiot</i>, don't you?! Like the others! That I wouldn't understand... that I'm just some <i>grunt</i>!<br><br>You... I thought you were different than them, <i>better</i> than them. Maybe I was wrong... <i>maybe</i> I need to do one <i>last</i> thing!"
// Answer Text :
"P757658164" "And what would that be, Harris?"
// Page UsedMe Text :
"P2216035927" "I'm going to KILL YOU!"
// Answer Text :
"P774985231" "Just try it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Kuzmin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P905683375" "{HeroName}, good of you to make it back.<br><br>Your name is becoming well known around here in Mercy. Of course, not in the most pleasant way. Many people here seemed to be counting on Longbow to 'free' them from the deeds of people such as yourself.<br><br>They even believed there was no way that Longbow would be defeated. It was all quite laughable."
// Answer Text :
"P1523529512" "It is. So did you just want to congratulate me, or...?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3418109604" "Somewhat. I've been ordered to give you this letter from Kalinda, and to inform you that you've made a lasting impression on the organization of Arachnos.<br><br>To be honest, you made many in the group look like fools. They had said it was impossible to kick Longbow out, and yet you made it happen without much effort. Some are not happy about that, not at all."
// Answer Text :
"P3903568023" "Well, I'm honored that Arachnos has recognized me."
// Answer Text :
"P3822505340" "I honestly couldn't care less about Arachnos. Are we done?"
// Page Honored Text :
"P1522271924" "As you should be. Arachnos is a powerful organization, one that can change your life - for better or worse.<br><br>Should you wish to seek more power, find the ferry and get yourself to <color yellow>Port Oakes</color>. There is much opportunity there.<br><br>But be warned. In Mercy, Arachnos had much to focus on. In other parts of the island, our soldiers will not be as... friendly as they were here.<br><br>They will see you as a threat and as a way to make a name for themselves. But I do not believe someone such as yourself would be ended in such a way. That is all, {HeroName}, I have much to do still for the glory of Arachnos."
// Answer Text :
"P82374953" "Of course. Goodbye, Kuzmin."
// Page AreWeDone Text :
"P3428500828" "... Hrmph. We are done, {HeroName}. Do not be surprised, with that attitude, when you are assaulted by Arachnos in areas outside of Mercy.<br><br>Others will seek to put you in their place, and perhaps I do not blame them. Should you decide to go to <color yellow>Port Oakes</color> by the ferry, I would advise that you do your best to curb your attitude.<br><br>Regardless, this is the last that you and I will speak, for now. Goodbye, {HeroName}. I would say I will miss you, but that would imply that I would degrade myself to have such feelings."
// Answer Text :
"P1570142142" "Right. See you aorund."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1283293028" "The last thing we have to deal with is the sudden reinforcements from the Legacy Chain. Longbow believes they can help turn the tide, but they cannot.<br><br>Afterwards, you can get into Fort Darwin from an entrance on the beach. The main target is the medi-porter system that they have set up. Once that's destroyed, we can ensure that any Longbow we deal with will <i>not</i> be returning."
// AcceptString :
"P3053212557" "And Lt. Page?"
// SendOffString :
"P2977355987" "You and I will deal with her ourselves, once the medi-porter system is down. Once you're in, I will stage my return.<br><br>In the chaos of your attack, I will make my own move to disable more of their defenses. You and I will then meet up at some point to finish off whatever remains of the Longbow troops in Darwin.<br><br>This is it, {HeroName}! You will get your freedom from Longbow, and I will get my vengeance against those who have wronged me!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4287412705" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: What I Wanted</color>"

