// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P1693673239" "Dario Stanzini"
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P87227366" "{HeroName}.<em>I've not forgotten what you've done, that you saved me back in that lab.<em>I am here to repay your favor. Consider us even after all of this is finished."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1340838833" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>Harris here. I'm confronting Lt. Page now. <t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>Harris! What in the world are you doing?! <t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>You brought this on yourself, Page! I will NOT be trifled with.  You will learn that, along with all of Longbow! <t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>What?! Harris, have you gone MAD?! "
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P833687765" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>All of this... all of this because I did not return your feelings for me?!<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkRed>No, for the ridicule, Mariska. I saw it in your eyes! In the way you... and EVERYONE... talked DOWN to me afterwards, as if I was NOTHING!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>I did nothing of the sort, Harris! It was all in your head! <t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor RoyalBlue>There is something seriously wrong with you. You were never supposed to come here, you were supposed to get help!"

